# Node
node_modules
dist
.env

# api/[...path].js is deliberately NOT gitignored, unlike dist/ above --
# see the comment in that file. Vercel's function-to-route wiring requires
# the file to exist in the pre-build git tree (confirmed for the
# `functions` vercel.json key earlier on this branch; a build-time-only
# file never got a route no matter what routing mechanism was tried).
# vercel.json's buildCommand overwrites its real contents on every deploy.

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local-only project instructions -- must never be pushed to GitHub,
# per standing instruction. Claude Code still reads it locally regardless
# of git-tracking status; this only prevents it from being committed.
CLAUDE.md
